OL,3,APrince Harry and six others face
OL,4,Aprivacy case legal bill of up to #34.5m
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrince Harry and six other public
OL,7,Ffigures face paying up to #34.5m to the
OL,8,Fpublisher of the Daily Mail after a
OL,9,FHigh Court judge imposed an exceptional
OL,10,Forder for legal costs over their failed
OL,11,Fprivacy case.
OL,13,FThe seven claimants, also including Sir
OL,14,FElton John and Liz Hurley, must pay an
OL,15,Finitial #9.54m by Friday of next week
OL,16,Fto Associated Newspapers Limited (ANL).
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
