OL,3,ARussian strikes on Ukraine kill two,
OL,4,Aofficials say, a day after deadly
OL,5,Aattack on mall
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Russian defence ministry said it
OL,8,Flaunched massive strikes targeting
OL,9,Ftransport infrastructure and
OL,10,Fwarehouses.
OL,12,FThe attacks follow a deadly Russian
OL,13,Fdouble-tap drone strike on a busy mall
OL,14,Fin Kryvyi Rih on Friday that President
OL,15,FVolodymyr Zelensky called "absolutely
OL,16,Fcynical and despicable".
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
